---
permalink: /changes/
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: What's changed in the trust framework
---
{#
  Changes to the trust framework wording since its baseline (framework-baseline.json).
  Only the files under trust-framework-1.0/ count. See lib/changes.js.
#}
{% set changes = frameworkChanges %}
{% set baseline = changes.baseline %}
<div class="govuk-grid-row">
  <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds-from-desktop">
    <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">{{ title }}</h1>

    {% if not changes.available %}
      <div class="govuk-inset-text" data-framework-status="unavailable">
        <p class="govuk-body">Information about changes is not available in this copy of the site.</p>
      </div>
    {% elif changes.unchanged %}
      <div class="govuk-inset-text app-framework-status" data-framework-status="unchanged">
        <p class="govuk-body-l govuk-!-margin-bottom-0"><strong>The current working draft contains no changes to trust framework content compared with {{ baseline.name }}.</strong></p>
        <p class="govuk-body govuk-!-margin-top-2 govuk-!-margin-bottom-0">Changes shown here are part of the working draft and do not by themselves change the published trust framework.</p>
      </div>
    {% else %}
      {% set count = changes.sections | length %}
      <div class="govuk-inset-text app-framework-status" data-framework-status="changed" data-changed-sections="{{ count }}">
        <p class="govuk-body-l govuk-!-margin-bottom-0"><strong>The current working draft differs from {{ baseline.name }} in {{ count }} {{ "section" if count == 1 else "sections" }}.</strong></p>
        <p class="govuk-body govuk-!-margin-top-2 govuk-!-margin-bottom-0">Changes shown here are part of the working draft and do not by themselves change the published trust framework.</p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if changes.available %}
      <dl class="govuk-summary-list">
        <div class="govuk-summary-list__row">
          <dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">Compared with</dt>
          <dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">
            {% if baseline.url %}<a class="govuk-link" href="{{ baseline.url }}">{{ baseline.description or baseline.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ baseline.description or baseline.name }}{% endif %}
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="govuk-summary-list__row">
          <dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">Working draft</dt>
          <dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">The current working draft (<code class="app-code">main</code>)</dd>
        </div>
        {# Only commits that changed how the framework looks count: wording, links or formatting, never repository-only work. #}
        {% if changes.current.lastChanged %}
          <div class="govuk-summary-list__row">
            <dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">Trust framework content last changed</dt>
            <dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">{{ changes.current.lastChanged | readableDate }}</dd>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </dl>

      {% if not changes.unchanged %}
        <table class="govuk-table">
          <caption class="govuk-table__caption govuk-table__caption--m">Changed sections</caption>
          <thead class="govuk-table__head">
            <tr class="govuk-table__row">
              <th scope="col" class="govuk-table__header">Section</th>
              <th scope="col" class="govuk-table__header">What changed</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="govuk-table__body">
            {% for section in changes.sections %}
              <tr class="govuk-table__row">
                <th scope="row" class="govuk-table__header">
                  <a class="govuk-link app-changed-section" href="/changes/{{ section.slug }}/">{{ section.title }}</a>
                </th>
                <td class="govuk-table__cell">{{ section.summary }}</td>
              </tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      {% endif %}
    {% endif %}

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">What this page covers</h2>
    <p class="govuk-body">
      This page compares only the content of the trust framework: its wording, links and formatting. Changes to this website,
      the feedback forms and the tools used to maintain the repository are not changes to the trust framework, so they are
      not listed here.
    </p>
    <p class="govuk-body">
      Some changes say why they were made, with links to where they were raised and where they were reviewed and accepted on GitHub.
      Only explanations that OfDIA has chosen to publish are shown, so many changes have none.
    </p>
    <p class="govuk-body">
      A change accepted into the working draft takes effect only when OfDIA publishes a new version on GOV.UK.
      The <a class="govuk-link" href="{{ site.publishedUrl }}">published trust framework</a> on GOV.UK is authoritative.
    </p>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Repository history</h2>
    <p class="govuk-body">
      For maintainers, the <a class="govuk-link" href="{{ repositoryUrl }}/commits/main">repository history on GitHub</a>
      lists every accepted change, including changes to this website and its tools.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
